<title>JAPAN: Itoham - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Itoham - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		465.54		vs	  477.72</p>
<p> Operating	    4.67		vs	    6.62</p>
<p> Current		4.17		vs	    6.43</p>
<p> Net		  972    million    vs	    3.12</p>
<p> EPS		    4.26 yen	  vs	   13.65 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	  4.26 yen	  vs	   13.51 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Itoham Foods Inc is a major manufacturer of ham and sausages.</p>
